    "summary": "A Kustomize Helm config home can run commands in the repo-server",
    "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nWhen Kustomize Helm chart rendering is enabled, a kustomization can point Helm at a directory the repository controls and run a program from that directory inside `argocd-repo-server`. Kustomize copies `helmGlobals.configHome` into Helm\u2019s config and data directories. Helm then loads a ...",
