    "summary": "A Kustomize remote ref can run commands in the repo-server",
    "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nKustomize passes a remote resource, base, or component URL to `git fetch`, and appends that URL\u2019s `ref` or `version` query value with no `--` separator. A value that starts with `-`, such as `--upload-pack=<command>`, is parsed as a Git option. `--upload-pack` runs that command inside ...",
